          "guid": "mt6sks6024zddazb",
          "message": {
            "text": "The strict transaction activates only after both caller-owned clocks agree, because Chromium presents video on compositor begin-frames and an after-navigation rAF shim cannot prove page callback ownership. Ordinary capture therefore remains observational, while this path can fail closed without overstating authority. Chromium 7d859f27 videoframesubmitter.cc:531-572 owns Update/Get/Submit/Put for one frame and lines 782-785 reject duplicate frame submission.",
            "markdown": "The strict transaction activates only after both caller-owned clocks agree, because Chromium presents video on compositor begin-frames and an after-navigation rAF shim cannot prove page callback ownership. Ordinary capture therefore remains observational, while this path can fail closed without overstating authority. Chromium 7d859f27 video_frame_submitter.cc:531-572 owns Update/Get/Submit/Put for one frame and lines 782-785 reject duplicate frame submission."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
